    "Person's hands | holding bowl over jar at 0s | repositioning, pushing, withdrawing through 9s | motion blur during repositioning at ~4s; all reaches arrive at their target (bowl, jar rim) rather than dissolving",
    "Metal bowl on counter (right) | full of green olives at 0s | fewer olives with brown fragments visible by ~5s | no person action toward it in shot; content change is state bookkeeping (out of scope, not a causality report)"
